[{"text":"இரண்டு","lemma":"iraṇṭu","gloss":"two"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"in","gloss":"inflectional increment"},{"text":"உள்","lemma":"uḷ","gloss":"among"}],"gloss":"among the two"},{"surface":"ஒன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்று","lemma":"oṉṟu","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one"},{"surface":"ஆகாமையோ","parts":[{"text":"ஆகாமை","lemma":"ākāmai","gloss":"not happening"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"clitic"}],"gloss":"not happening"},{"surface":"அரிதே","parts":[{"text":"அரிது","lemma":"aritu","gloss":"rare/impossible"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is impossible"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காஞ்சி","parts":[{"text":"காஞ்சி","lemma":"kāñci","gloss":"Kāñci tree"}],"gloss":"Kāñci tree"},{"surface":"பனிமுறி","parts":[{"text":"பனி","lemma":"paṉi","gloss":"cool/dew"},{"text":"முறி","lemma":"muṟi","gloss":"tender shoot"}],"gloss":"cool tender shoots"},{"surface":"ஆரம்","parts":[{"text":"ஆரம்","lemma":"āram","gloss":"sandalwood"}],"gloss":"sandalwood"},{"surface":"கண்ணி","parts":[{"text":"கண்ணி","lemma":"kaṇṇi","gloss":"chaplet"}],"gloss":"chaplet"},{"surface":"…","parts":[{"text":"…","lemma":"…","gloss":"gap"}],"gloss":"gap"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கணி","parts":[{"text":"கணி","lemma":"kaṇi","gloss":"Vēṅkai tree"}],"gloss":"Vēṅkai tree"},{"surface":"மேவந்தவள்","parts":[{"text":"மேவந்தவள்","lemma":"மேவந்தவள்","gloss":"she who is desirable"}],"gloss":"she who is desirable","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அல்குல்","parts":[{"text":"அல்குல்","lemma":"alkul","gloss":"loins"}],"gloss":"loins"},{"surface":"அவ்","parts":[{"text":"அவ்","lemma":"அவ்","gloss":"those"}],"gloss":"those","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வரியே","parts":[{"text":"வரி","lemma":"vari","gloss":"beauty lines"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"beauty lines"}]}],"literal":"Red paddy eaten green-feathered peacock / tight-bangle women flying and rising / near the ghat on the marutam tree perching town with / abundant precious wealth giving, is it one? / smoke-producing intense fire spreading, waging war / virtueless aggressive valor bringing, is it the other? / Among the two, not happening either one is impossible! / Kāñci cool tender shoots and sandal chaplet … / Vēṅkai-like desirable girl's loins' those beauty lines!","translation":"Because of those beautiful lines on the loins of this desirable girl, who wears a chaplet of cool tender shoots of Kāñci and sandal, either of two things must happen: One is that her kinsmen will give her hand in marriage, offering abundant precious wealth along with their town—where peacocks with fresh feathers, having eaten red paddy, fly up when startled by women wearing tight bangles and perch on the marutam tree near the water-ghat. The other is that the suitors will wage war, spreading smoke-producing intense fire, and show ruthless, aggressive valor. It is impossible that neither of these two outcomes will occur!","modern":"செந்நெல்லை உண்ட பசுமையான இறகுகளைக் கொண்ட மயில், செறிந்த வளையல்களை அணிந்த பெண்கள் ஆரவாரிப்பதால் பறந்து எழுந்து, நீர்த்துறைக்கு அருகில் உள்ள மருத மரத்தில் தங்கும் வளமான ஊருடன், நிறைந்த சிறந்த செல்வத்தை (மணக்கொடையாகத்) தருவது ஒரு வழியாகும். அல்லது, புகை எழும் கூர்மையான நெருப்பைப் பரப்பிப் பகைமை பாராட்டி, இரக்கமற்ற வீரத்தைக் காட்டுவது மற்றொரு வழியாகும். காஞ்சி மரத்தின் குளிர்ந்த தளிர் மற்றும் சந்தனம் ஆகியவற்றால் தொடுத்த மாலையை அணிந்தவளும், வேங்கை மரம் போன்ற அழகு பொருந்தியவளுமான இவளது அல்குலில் உள்ள அழகிய வரிகளுக்காக, இவ்விரண்டில் ஒன்று நிகழாமல் போவது அரிதாகும்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Puram genre, specifically under the theme of 'Makaṭpāṟ Kāñci' (refusal of a girl's hand in marriage, leading to conflict). The poet, Aṭaineṭuṅ Kalviyār, describes the beauty of a young woman whose hand is sought by powerful kings. Her father and kinsmen are reluctant to give her away, which sets up an inevitable conflict. The poet states that there are only two possible outcomes: either the kinsmen will yield and give her in marriage along with their prosperous town and immense wealth, or the suitors will wage a destructive war, burning down the town with ruthless valor. The imagery of the peacock eating red paddy and perching on the marutam tree highlights the fertility and peace of the town, which is now threatened by devastating war. The key phrase 'iraṇṭiṉuḷ oṉṟā kāmaiyō aritē' emphasizes that a peaceful union or a destructive war is unavoidable.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,2.7],[2.7,2.84],[2.84,2.84],[2.84,2.84],[2.84,3.7],[3.7,3.88],[3.88,5.1],[5.1,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,7.1],[7.1,7.7],[7.7,8.0],[8.0,8.1],[8.1,9.2],[9.2,9.2],[9.2,9.2],[9.2,11.0],[11.0,11.8],[11.8,12.2],[12.2,12.6],[12.6,12.6],[12.6,14.1],[14.1,14.34],[14.6,15.0],[15.0,15.5],[15.5,17.0],[17.18,17.3],[17.3,17.6],[17.6,17.9],[18.0,18.5],[18.6,19.1],[19.1,19.79],[19.79,20.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.6],[1.6,1.7],[1.9,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.9,3.8],[3.8,3.8],[3.8,5.38],[5.7,6.1],[6.1,6.2],[6.2,6.2],[6.2,8.3],[8.3,8.8],[8.8,8.9],[8.9,9.79],[9.79,9.97],[9.97,11.4],[11.4,12.1],[12.1,12.9],[12.9,13.4],[13.4,13.8],[13.8,13.9],[13.9,15.6],[15.6,16.0],[16.0,16.0],[16.0,17.1],[17.1,17.4],[17.4,17.7],[17.7,18.0],[18.0,18.3],[20.48,20.72],[20.84,21.34],[21.34,22.03],[22.03,22.34]]},"sync":[[["செந்நெல்","red paddy"]],[["உண்ட","that ate"]],[["பைந்தோட்டு","having fresh feathers"]],[["மஞ்ஞை","peacock"]],[["செறிவளை","tight bangles"]],[["மகளிர்","women"]],[["பறந்து","having flown"],["எழுந்து","having risen"]],[["துறைநணி","near the ghat"]],[["மருதத்து","on the marutam tree"]],[["இறுக்கும்","that perches"]],[["ஊரொடு","with the town"]],[["நிறைசால்","abundant"]],[["விழுப்பொருள்","precious wealth"]],[["தருதல்","giving"]],[["ஒன்றோ","is it one option"]],[["புகைபடு","smoke-producing"]],[["கூர்எரி","intense fire"]],[["பரப்பி","having spread"],["பகைசெய்து","waging war"]],[["பகைசெய்து","waging war"]],[["பண்பில்","virtueless"]],[["ஆண்மை","aggressive valor"]],[["தருதல்","bringing"]],[["ஒன்றோ","or the other option"]],[["இரண்டினுள்","among the two"]],[["ஒன்று",